{"word":"πώς","uri":"pôs_(2)","senses":[{"word":"πώς","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">πώς,</span></span> <span class=\"ital\">adv. indéf.\nenclitique,</span> de quelque façon, en quelque manière,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’ord.</span> <span class=\"ital\">en un sens\nd’atténuation :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec\nun adj. :</span> <span class=\"grec\">τοιαῦτα... πώς,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Att.</span> à peu près de telles choses ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec\nun adv. :</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὧδέ πως,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">3, 3, 7,</span> à peu près ainsi ; <span class=\"grec\">ἄλλως πως,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 1, 20,</span> de qqe autre\nmanière ; <span class=\"grec\">μόγις πως,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Prot.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">328</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span>, avec quelque peine\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> <span class=\"ital\">particul.</span> <span class=\"ital\">après</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">γάρ,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Pr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">224,</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Ch.</span> <span class=\"refch\">958,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">4</span> avec un verbe :\n<span class=\"grec\">ἠθάς εἰμί πως τῶν τῆσδε μύθων,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">El.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">372,</span> j’ai quelque habitude de l’entendre\nparler ; <span class=\"grec\">πράσσοντές πως ταῦτα,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 3,</span>\nfaisant à peu près ainsi ; <span class=\"ital\">cf.</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\